%% Capture a session (requirement 0004) — acknowledge first, import the material afterwards.
%% Derived from ADR 0005 (acknowledge before processing), ADR 0006 (owner on every write),
%% ADR 0008 (event in the same write), ADR 0013 (import into the learner's corpus),
%% ADR 0016 (the ragFile id is what scopes later retrieval), spec 0010, CLAUDE.md.
%% Changed 2026-09-29: "read the material" is now "import, chunk, embed, index" into the
%% learner's own RAG Engine corpus. The learner sees a state because that interval is real —
%% about twenty seconds to create a corpus and ten to import a 900 KB PDF, observed, not promised.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor L as Learner — phone, poor connection
  participant W as apps/web
  participant A as apps/api
  participant S as Cloud Storage
  participant F as Firestore
  participant R as Vertex AI RAG Engine<br/>this learner's corpus — us-central1

  L->>W: choose the course and session, attach a file,<br/>optionally write what they took from it
  W->>A: capture — Bearer ID token
  A->>S: store the file — the object key carries the file extension<br/>RAG Engine infers type from it and silently rejects an import without one
  S-->>A: gs:// URI
  A->>F: one write — Material { learner, session, gsUri, state: reading }, and the event (ADR 0008)
  A-->>W: 202 within seconds — ADR 0005  ·  independent of document size
  W-->>L: the session exists and is usable  ·  this material shows as being read
  Note over L,R: the learner can close the page here and nothing is lost
  A->>R: ensure the corpus for this learner, then import the object<br/>corpus identity comes from the authenticated caller — never from the request (ADR 0013)
  alt import reports one file imported
    R-->>A: ragFile id
    A->>F: Material { state: ready, ragFileId, readyAt }<br/>readyAt − createdAt is the five-minute bound in PRD §5, measured
  else import reports zero imported — the API calls this a successful operation
    R-->>A: importedRagFilesCount = 0
    A->>F: Material { state: failed, error: a reason the learner can read }
    Note over A,F: reading the count is the only way to know it did not work
  end
  W->>A: poll while any material is reading
  A-->>W: the states
  W-->>L: ready, or failed with the reason  ·  never a spinner that lies
